      "startLine": 73,
      "endLine": 73,
      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "Assistant: 主人，故障找到了！🌸 **问题根因**：Gateway重启Cron触发间隔配置错误，导致每8分钟反复重启一次，刚启动完成又被重启命令打断，周而复始。 **解决**：停用这个异常的Cron任务，改为手动执行一次重启即可。",
      "recallCount": 0,
      "dailyCount": 1,
      "groundedCount": 0,
      "totalScore": 0.58,
      "maxScore": 0.58,
      "firstRecalledAt": "2026-04-29T23:21:32.666Z",
      "lastRecalledAt": "2026-04-29T23:21:32.666Z",
      "queryHashes": [
        "e29ad1ab29b1"
      ],
      "recallDays": [
