    "memory:memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-05-15.txt:69:69": {
      "key": "memory:memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-05-15.txt:69:69",
      "path": "memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-05-15.txt",
      "startLine": 69,
      "endLine": 69,
      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "User: Assistant: 你说得对，我刚才算的10.57万字符和番茄的9.7万字有差距，问题在于**编码计算方式不同**： | 统计方式 | 1-28章结果 | 说明 | |----------|-----------|------| | 我的脚本（UTF-8字符数） | **10.57万字符** | 每个中文UTF-8编码占3字节，字节÷3=字符 | | 番茄显示 | **9.7万字** | 番茄的统计标准 | **番茄的算法**：字节数 ÷ 3 ≈ 字数 → 298380 ÷ 3 = **9.9万**（接近9.7万） **番茄为什么比我的字符",
      "recallCount": 0,
      "dailyCount": 1,
      "groundedCount": 0,
      "totalScore": 0.58,
      "maxScore": 0.58,
      "firstRecalledAt": "2026-05-16T01:05:01.932Z",
      "lastRecalledAt": "2026-05-16T01:05:01.932Z",
      "queryHashes": [
